    "details": "<p><strong>Join the official group for information and updates:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/DE4JhUortEqAD35baNLw4k\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/DE4JhUortEqAD35baNLw4k</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Benefits and Opportunities:</strong></p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li><strong>Top 3 teams:</strong> Paid internship opportunities</li>\n<li><strong>Top 3 teams</strong>: 30,000 prize pool</li>\n<li><strong>Every participant: </strong>&nbsp;<code dir=\"ltr\">.xyz</code> domain and .cv domain</li>\n<li><strong>Every participant:</strong> Verifiable digital certificate</li>\n<li><strong>Every participant:</strong> $100 in Inkloom AI credits, $500 in Adaption platform credits, 100$ ASI Credits</li>\n<li><strong>Rewards and benefits:</strong> 100+ recipients across the hackathon</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Format:</strong></p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li><strong>Hackathon Date: 3 December &mdash; 13 December 2026<br /></strong></li>\n<li><strong>No.of Rounds: 3</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Mode:</strong> Completely online</li>\n<li><strong>Team size:</strong> 1&ndash;6 members</li>\n<li><strong>Registration fee:</strong>&nbsp;free</li>\n<li><strong>Track: </strong>Agentic<strong> </strong>AI, Full Stack Development</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rules:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participants must submit original work within the deadline and follow all event guidelines.</li>\n<li>Plagiarism, false information, or multiple submissions may result in disqualification.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to students, developers, designers, and technology enthusiasts across India.</li>\n<li>Participants may join individually or form a team according to the event&rsquo;s permitted team size.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Process:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Register for the event, join the official communication group, and complete every announced round.</li>\n<li>Qualified participants will receive the instructions and submission details for th